# % (percentSign)

- _m % n_

The modulus operator `mod`.

```
>>> 8 % 3
mod(8, 3)
```

The name of this operator is `percentSign`:

```
>>> 'm % n'.splSimplify
'percentSign(m, n)'
```

* * *

See also: /, //, \\, mod

Guides: Binary Operators

Unicode: U+0025 % Percent Sign

Categories: Math, Operator
